SUMMARY:Advanced B Ride (16-18 mph)\nBV Eastern Lanc County Half Century -
  52R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nBe Safe\, Have Fun\, and 
 Ride Together\n\nRide leader: Dave Evans\nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\nAnti
 cipated Average Pace: (16-18 mph)\nRoute: https://routes.lancasterbikeclub
 .net/cue/bv-eastern-lancaster-county-half-century-52h/\n\nThis is an Advan
 ced B ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed. Thi
 s is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The
  ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasion
 al regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capa
 bilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride w
 ith the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yours
 elf and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-18 mph aver
 age is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slowe
 r ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and
  a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo 
 eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club memb
 ership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not m
 ean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancaster
 bikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your 
 agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGui
 dance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3158353
 60/
